# Every screen of 2048, for docs/apps/twos.md: a game in play, the restart question, then game over.
open app twos
swipe left
swipe down
swipe left
swipe down
swipe right
swipe down
expect text "Score"
snapshot playing
tap 120 120                 # ask to restart
expect text "Restart game?"
snapshot restart
tap 74 89                   # no, keep playing
